00:19:33.360 --> 00:19:35.070
<i>Stay away from that sector!</i>

00:19:35.070 --> 00:19:35.900
Shut up!

00:19:35.900 --> 00:19:39.360
Desil took control of Zafar and Ned and got them killed.

00:19:39.900 --> 00:19:41.450
If you go, you'll be next.

00:19:41.450 --> 00:19:42.820
<i>Wh-What?</i>

00:19:43.280 --> 00:19:46.030
And the Gundam's there, too.

00:19:46.620 --> 00:19:49.120
I can't estimate his current power.

00:19:49.120 --> 00:19:51.920
He's not supposed to be an X-Rounder!

00:19:51.920 --> 00:19:53.290
<i>This is an order!</i>

00:20:13.020 --> 00:20:14.690
I can't read him!

00:20:14.690 --> 00:20:15.560
Why not?

00:20:15.900 --> 00:20:17.940
He's not even an X-Rounder!

00:20:23.070 --> 00:20:27.660
What... What are you?!

00:20:31.540 --> 00:20:32.290
I'm...

00:20:35.630 --> 00:20:36.880
I'm...

00:20:39.210 --> 00:20:41.630
...the super pilot! {tlc}

00:20:43.800 --> 00:20:47.300
Asemu Asuno!

00:20:58.060 --> 00:20:59.020
Why?

00:21:00.110 --> 00:21:04.490
I can't lose! It's impossible!{inb4 he comes back alive and dies to the third asuno}

00:21:09.030 --> 00:21:12.290
You let your own brother die.

00:21:12.290 --> 00:21:14.960
Was that your plan all along?

00:21:14.960 --> 00:21:16.880
Watch your mouth, Dole.

00:21:18.000 --> 00:21:22.050
Even my brother, if he got in the way...

00:21:22.420 --> 00:21:25.800
I swore I'd get there, no matter what.

00:21:26.430 --> 00:21:29.970
To the future Lord Ezelcant showed me.

00:21:31.060 --> 00:21:32.890
The future...

00:21:34.770 --> 00:21:35.810
That's strange.

00:21:36.140 --> 00:21:37.350
What is?

00:21:37.350 --> 00:21:41.610
Why aren't the enemy attacking Nortrum itself?

00:21:43.320 --> 00:21:44.610
I see it now!

00:21:45.200 --> 00:21:48.450
Order the fleet to launch a full attack on the enemy mobile fortress!

00:21:49.910 --> 00:21:53.790
Throw everything we have at it, even Nortrum's defense forces!

00:21:53.790 --> 00:21:55.540
If we do that...

00:21:55.540 --> 00:21:58.380
The enemy isn't out to destroy the colony.

00:22:00.540 --> 00:22:02.880
Algreus, I'll leave you in charge.

